      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For reference, the prototype mod for this (Advanced Safety) had *options* to exclude friends and abide by \"show avatar\" (or not) for avatar hiding (it had by-ID and by-author), similar to what distance avatar hider has currently. Given that people use \"show avatar\" in different ways, as Salbug has described (which is very different from what I do), it would make sense to provide these options here too.\nAs a side note, most of my `showAvatar` moderations come from getting AS to not chop up terribly optimized avatars into oblivion. In the new EAC'd client, my use of `showAvatar` would be limited to rare visitors/new users - I personally would prefer it to override by-ID hides because of that.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
