      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Definitely agree. If they feel like it might be confusing for people, they can add an \"Avatar hidden by ID\" icon to let people know why the avatar isn't shown.\nI use Show Avatar a lot simply because I block all Very Poor avatars by default. I'd likely only use the Hide Avatar by ID on nuisance/meme avatars with annoying sounds and effects. I wouldn't want them to show up even if my best friend was wearing it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
