      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agreed. Although I can see the case for both ways, hiding a specific avatar ID seems like a much more intentional choice than showing or not showing a single person, and I would expect it to override Show Avatar by default.\nApologies if I missed something, but will there at least be something on the UI to indicate a player is using an ID hidden avatar before you show them? Or perhaps a \"un-show people in the current world with ID-hidden avatars\" button?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
